PAYLOAD
Payload_X recieves the Start_File_Transfer message. Then sends the ACK command with
    id of the Start_File_Transfer message

Payload_X starts recieving File Packets
// POTENTIAL FAULT INJECTION
* Recieving missing Packets
* Recieving out of order Packets
* Not recieving anything
* Taking too long to recieve files

Payload_X completes the file transfer and send the File_Transfer_Complete_Status 
    message with SFTP_status = 0 (for success) or SFTP_status = 1 (for failure) 